      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To target specific biases, you can focus on subtle tropes related to competence or cultural stereotypes. For socioeconomic assumptions, use comments implying someone needs \"help adjusting to the corporate culture.\" Intelligence bias might manifest as, \"I'm surprised you understand this technical jargon.\" When targeting cultural aptitude, look for remarks like, \"You handle interviews so professionally for someone from your background.\" These archetypes help segment bias into themes like competence challenges or cultural assimilation pressure.",
